Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:07:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/21] ttf: a USE_MY_METRICS component places its composite

A composite takes the phantom points of a component flagged USE_MY_METRICS
(the last one, untransformed), so it is drawn shifted as that component is,
not by its own lsb - xMin. An accented I whose own lsb is stale but whose I
carries the flag was read 11 units right of where it is drawn.

barx in the fixture: bar flagged USE_MY_METRICS, the composite's own lsb 30
units further right than bar's.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
